{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-database-polyglot","title":"多数据库混用架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/multi-database-polyglot","wordCount":1765,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多数据库混用架构\">多数据库混用架构</h1><p>「用正确的工具做正确的事」——Polyglot Persistence 的核心信条简洁有力，但实践中它带来了显著的运维复杂度：多套监控体系、多种备份策略、多个故障域、跨库事务一致性、以及团队认知负载的几何级增长。本文不讨论是否应该混用（答案几乎总是「某种程度上是的」），而是聚焦<strong>如何安全地混用</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多数据库混用架构的三个治理支柱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>架构模式选择</strong>：主库+物化视图、域分治（Domain Ownership）、Lakehouse 联邦——按一致性需求和团队结构选择</li>\n<li><strong>跨库一致性策略</strong>：从分布式事务到 Saga 补偿再到容忍不一致——按业务后果递减选择</li>\n<li><strong>运维治理框架</strong>：统一监控面板、备份矩阵、依赖图维护——每增一种库加 0.5 FTE 运维负荷</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"混用的驱动力与代价\">混用的驱动力与代价</h2><p>任何超过中等复杂度的系统都会自然产生多种数据访问模式，每种模式最适合不同类型的数据库。<a href=\"../selection-framework/workload-analysis-methodology\">工作负载分析</a> 的输出往往指向多个数据库家族：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据域</th>\n<th>最佳引擎</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户账户、订单（OLTP）</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL / Aurora</td>\n<td>ACID 事务、关系完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品目录（灵活 schema）</td>\n<td>MongoDB / DynamoDB</td>\n<td>异构属性、高读吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话缓存（低延迟）</td>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>亚毫秒响应、TTL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索索引</td>\n<td>Elasticsearch / OpenSearch</td>\n<td>全文搜索、聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件流（追加写入）</td>\n<td>Kafka + ClickHouse</td>\n<td>高写入吞吐、分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 嵌入（语义检索）</td>\n<td>pgvector / Pinecone</td>\n<td>向量近邻搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交关系（图遍历）</td>\n<td>Neo4j</td>\n<td>多跳关系查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每引入一种新数据库，运维复杂度按以下公式增长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{ops} = C_{base} \\cdot N_{db} \\cdot (1 + \\alpha \\cdot N_{integration})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{db}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是数据库种类数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{integration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是跨库数据流数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是集成复杂度系数（0.1-0.5）。经验法则：每增加一种数据库类型，至少增加 0.5 个 FTE 的运维负荷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构模式\">架构模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-主库-物化视图\">模式一：主库 + 物化视图</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    App[应用层] --&gt;|CRUD| Primary[主数据库 PostgreSQL]&#10;    Primary --&gt;|CDC| Sync[同步管道]&#10;    Sync --&gt;|搜索索引| ES[Elasticsearch]&#10;    Sync --&gt;|缓存| Redis[Redis]&#10;    Sync --&gt;|分析| CH[ClickHouse]&#10;    App --&gt;|搜索| ES&#10;    App --&gt;|缓存读| Redis&#10;    App --&gt;|报表| CH\">graph TD\n    App[应用层] --&gt;|CRUD| Primary[主数据库 PostgreSQL]\n    Primary --&gt;|CDC| Sync[同步管道]\n    Sync --&gt;|搜索索引| ES[Elasticsearch]\n    Sync --&gt;|缓存| Redis[Redis]\n    Sync --&gt;|分析| CH[ClickHouse]\n    App --&gt;|搜索| ES\n    App --&gt;|缓存读| Redis\n    App --&gt;|报表| CH</pre><p>关键特征：PostgreSQL 是唯一的写入源（Single Source of Truth），其他数据库通过 CDC 管道异步填充。这保证了数据一致性——其他库是主库的物化视图。</p>\n<p>优势：写入路径简单、一致性有保证、回退容易（删除下游重建）。</p>\n<p>代价：下游数据有延迟（通常 1-10s）、CDC 管道本身需要监控和维护。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-域分治-domain-ownership\">模式二：域分治（Domain Ownership）</h3><p>微服务架构中更常见的模式。每个领域服务拥有自己的数据库，跨域通过 API 或事件通信：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>域服务</th>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>数据所有权</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户服务</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>账户、认证、配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品服务</td>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>产品目录、SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单服务</td>\n<td>Aurora</td>\n<td>订单、支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐服务</td>\n<td>Redis + 向量 DB</td>\n<td>特征缓存、嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析服务</td>\n<td>ClickHouse</td>\n<td>事件聚合、报表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种模式下，<strong>跨域一致性不再由数据库保证，而是由应用层通过 Saga 模式或事件驱动最终一致性实现</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式三-lakehouse-联邦\">模式三：Lakehouse 联邦</h3><p>将分析需求统一到数据湖层面，减少对在线数据库的分析查询压力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>各在线库通过 CDC → 数据湖（S3/GCS Parquet）</li>\n<li>BigQuery / Athena / Databricks 提供统一的 SQL 分析层</li>\n<li>反向 ETL 将分析结果回写到在线库</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年的新能力：AlloyDB Lakehouse Federation（Preview）允许 AlloyDB 直接查询 BigQuery 和 Cloud Storage 中的数据，无需 ETL。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨库数据一致性策略\">跨库数据一致性策略</h2><p>多库架构中最大的技术挑战是跨库一致性。按照从强到弱的保证级别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>一致性保证</th>\n<th>延迟代价</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分布式事务（2PC/XA）</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>高（所有参与者延迟之和）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saga + 补偿</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDC + 幂等消费</td>\n<td>最终一致（秒级）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双写 + 异步对账</td>\n<td>最终一致（分钟级）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容忍不一致 + 对账批处理</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实践建议</strong>：跨库分布式事务（XA）在云环境中几乎不可行——它要求所有参与数据库支持 XA 协议，且协调者的单点故障会导致资源锁定。Saga 模式（每步有对应的补偿操作）是更实际的选择。</p>\n<p>Saga 的正确性依赖于补偿操作的设计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 成功</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 可逆转 </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 的效果</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall i \\in [1,n]: T_i \\text{ 成功} \\implies C_i \\text{ 可逆转 } T_i \\text{ 的效果}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成功</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可逆转</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的效果</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型场景：订单创建 Saga</p>\n<ol>\n<li>订单服务创建订单（待支付状态）</li>\n<li>支付服务扣款</li>\n<li>库存服务扣减</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果步骤 3 失败，触发补偿：支付服务退款 → 订单标记失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运维治理框架\">运维治理框架</h2><p>多库环境需要统一的治理策略：</p>\n<p><strong>统一监控面板</strong>：所有数据库的关键指标（延迟、吞吐量、错误率、容量）汇聚到同一个仪表盘。推荐 Grafana + 各库的 Prometheus exporter，或云厂商的统一监控（AWS CloudWatch / GCP Cloud Monitoring）。</p>\n<p><strong>统一备份策略</strong>：每种数据库的备份频率、保留期、跨区域复制策略需要文档化。建议使用 backup matrix：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>RPO</th>\n<th>备份频率</th>\n<th>保留</th>\n<th>跨区域</th>\n<th>恢复验证频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>持续 WAL</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>持续 oplog</td>\n<td>14 天</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>1h</td>\n<td>每小时 RDB</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>季</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClickHouse</td>\n<td>24h</td>\n<td>每日快照</td>\n<td>90 天</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>季</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>依赖图维护</strong>：明确哪些服务依赖哪些数据库，以及数据流方向。当任一数据库故障时，快速判断影响范围。这张依赖图同时也是 <a href=\"migration-strategy-patterns\">迁移策略</a> 的规划输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该合并\">何时该合并</h2><p>混用不是越多越好。以下信号表明应该减少数据库种类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多个数据库存储的是同一份数据的不同视图，且同步延迟导致频繁的业务 bug</li>\n<li>团队花在维护同步管道上的时间超过了业务开发</li>\n<li>某个数据库的使用率低于 20%（合并到邻近的库）</li>\n<li>新版本的主数据库已经内置了之前需要专用库才能完成的功能（如 PG 的 pgvector 替代独立向量库）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合并决策的 ROI 计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI = \\frac{C_{ops\\_saved} + C_{licensing\\_saved}}{C_{migration} + C_{feature\\_loss\\_risk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4933em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4403em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.757em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI &gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 时，合并通常是值得的。监控合并后的系统需要重新建立性能基线——参见 <a href=\"dbaas-monitoring-tuning\">DBaaS 监控与调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Polyglot Persistence 是现实——超过中等复杂度的系统几乎必然使用多种数据库。关键不是避免混用，而是安全地混用：选择正确的架构模式（主库+物化视图最安全）、匹配恰当的一致性策略（Saga 比 XA 更实际）、建立统一的运维治理框架。每增加一种数据库类型都有真实的复杂度代价——在引入新库之前，先验证现有库是否真的无法满足需求（2026 年 PostgreSQL 通过扩展已经能覆盖全文搜索、向量检索、时序存储等多种场景）。当数据库种类超过 4 种时，应该主动评估合并机会。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多数据库混用架构","id":"多数据库混用架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"混用的驱动力与代价","id":"混用的驱动力与代价"},{"level":2,"text":"架构模式","id":"架构模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：主库 + 物化视图","id":"模式一-主库-物化视图"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：域分治（Domain Ownership）","id":"模式二-域分治-domain-ownership"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：Lakehouse 联邦","id":"模式三-lakehouse-联邦"},{"level":2,"text":"跨库数据一致性策略","id":"跨库数据一致性策略"},{"level":2,"text":"运维治理框架","id":"运维治理框架"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该合并","id":"何时该合并"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据库迁移策略与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/migration-strategy-patterns"},"next":{"title":"DBaaS 监控与调优实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/dbaas-monitoring-tuning"}}